<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed all five credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM	MAX    MIN    AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.788  bln pesos 14  days  31.28  31.25  31.28    2    2</p>
<p>1.788  bln pesos 12  days  31.32  31.31  31.31    2    2</p>
<p>1.788  bln pesos 11  days  31.40  31.35  31.38   10    5</p>
<p>1.000  bln pesos  5  days  31.20  30.95  31.08    8    4</p>
<p>1.000  bln pesos  3  days  31.00  30.92  30.93    2    2</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
